-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",334,{
[10657]="700442EF\n1\tTravel to Eryn Cordovath and assess the situation\tTravel to Eryn Cordovath and assess the situation.\n2\tFarmers can be found around Eryn Cordovath. You should rescue any farmers you find.\t\n3\tCollect saplings (total: 10)\tOne of the farmers wishes for you to gather saplings so that Crithost can tend to some of the orchard's crops even if the orchard is lost. You should gather saplings.\n4\tTalk to Tolwin\tTolwin can be found in the hall of Crithost. You should speak with Tolwin.\n",
[10658]="7003FFDD\n1\tUnlock doors (total: 2)\tThe people must be freed and rescued.\n",
[10659]="70027102\n1\tWarn the Dunlending abomination (total: 8)\tAbomination Dunlendings can be found at Lhan Colvarn, north of the Boar-clan encampment. Delwin wants you to save the abomination Dunlendings from the killing ways of her companions by warning them to flee.\n2\tTalk to Delwin at the Boar-clan encampment\tDelwin is at the Boar-clan encampment, south of Lhan Colvarn. You should return to Delwin and let her know that you have saved many of the Dunlending abominations.\n",
[10660]="700479C8\n1\tDouse the flames of burning brush around North Ithilien (total: 10)\tBrush fires have sprung up across North Ithilien. Thurindol has asked you to search North Ithilien for brush fires and put them out before they spread further.\n2\tTalk to Thurindol\tThurindol can be found in Henneth Annûn. You should return to Thurindol with news of your success.\n",
[10661]="700011F7\n1\tDefeat drakes in Dolroth (total: 8)\tDrakes can be found far to the east of Gabilshathûr, in the valley of Dolroth. Ansurr asked you to thin the numbers of the drakes.\n2\tTalk to Guard Ansurr\tGuard Ansurr is at Gabilshathûr, far to the west of the valley of Dolroth. You have defeated many drakes and should return to Guard Ansurr with news of your success.\n",
[10662]="700660C1\n1\tDefeat worms in Ost Amondal (total: 12)\tAbartârik has asked you to lessen the worm population in Ost Amondal. Ost Amondal is in southern Belfalas.\n2\tReturn to Abartârik\tYou should let Abartârik know that you defeated many worms at Ost Amondal. Abartârik is in Dol Amroth.\n",
[10663]="7000701B\n1\tCollect worm-scales\tWorms can be found in the western pass of Ram Dúath, north-east of Esteldín. You should gather worm-scales in the Ram Dúath.\n2\tCollect thick worm-scale (total: 10)\030Collect sturdy worm-scale (total: 6)\030Collect thin worm-scale (total: 4)\tWorms can be found in the western pass of Ram Dúath, north-east of Esteldín. You should gather worm-scales in the Ram Dúath.\n3\tBring the scales to Melthindir\tMelthindir is at Esteldín. You should bring the scales you collected to Melthindir.\n",
[10664]="70062F22\n1\tSpeak with the Scara-pack emissary\tYou may seek the blessing of the Scara-pack. All you need do is renounce all other clans.\n",
[10665]="7002717F\n1\tBring the rune-marked tree-bark to Gwilum in Barnavon\tGwilum is at the gate to Lower Barnavon. You should bring the rune-marked tree-bark to Gwilum.\n",
[10666]="7004E840\n1\tTalk to Dori at Dôm Goru\tDori can be found at Dôm Goru. You have learned that Vethúg Wintermind crashed upon the slopes of Winterstith, one of the Grey Mountains. You should follow Dori to the end of the Bitter Scar to learn the fate of Vethúg Wintermind.\n2\tTalk to Dori at Skarháld\tDori can be found in Skarháld. You have travelled to Skarháld with Dori and Company alongside Ingór, son of Vékun, and the Zhélruka. You should now speak to Dori.\n",
[10667]="70046BF5\n1\tCollect kingsfoil in North Ithilien (total: 8)\tKingsfoil can be found in North Ithilien to the west of Henneth Annûn. Anborn has asked you to gather kingsfoil in the hope that it might be used to heal his fellow Rangers.\n2\tWounded Rangers can be found within Henneth Annûn. You have gathered the kingsfoil and should now use it to heal the Rangers as best you can.\t\n3\tTalk to Anborn\tAnborn can be found at Henneth Annûn. You have healed the wounded Rangers as much as you were able, and should now report back to Anborn.\n",
[10668]="70057E69\n1\tTalk to Léothred at Hlithseld\tLéothred can be found at Hlithseld. You should talk to Léothred at Hlithseld.\n2\tTalk to Léothred at Hlithseld\tLéothred can be found at Hlithseld. You should talk to Léothred at Hlithseld.\n3\tTalk to Léothred at Framsburg\tLéothred wishes to return to Framsburg. You should talk to Léothred at Framsburg.\n",
[10669]="7004D08F\n1\tTalk to Fróthi\tYou should speak with Fróthi, who can be found in Erebor.\n2\tTalk to Fróthi\tYou should speak with the lore-master Fróthi, who can be found in Erebor.\n",
[10670]="70028262\n1\tScatter ashes before undisturbed cairns (total: 3)\tUndisturbed cairns lie to the east of Echad Naeglanc, along the southern ridge. Naeglanc has asked you to scatter ashes before undisturbed cairns in the Bonevales.\n2\tTalk to Mair among the cairns\tSeek out an ally among the cairns to the far eastern reaches of the Bonevales. You should speak with Mair\n",
[10671]="7000186D\n1\tSearch shattered barrels (total: 7)\tShattered barrels can be found strewn throughout the fens leading to Taur Gonwaith in the south of Lin Giliath. Aglardir has asked you to recover whatever supplies you can from the barrels the Stone-trolls scattered throughout the marshes.\n2\tBring supplies for Lin Giliath to Aglardir\tAglardir is in Lin Giliath, the glade on the border of Kingsfell and Meluinen. Aglardir is waiting for you to return with the possessions you salvaged from the shattered crates strewn about Meluinen.\n",
[10672]="70028187\n1\tFind and talk to Eiluned\030Find and talk to Glundur\tCaron's companions can be found east of his position, possibly near Bledhun's camp. Caron has asked you to seek out his companions and help them.\n2\tTalk to Bledhun at his encampment in the Bonevales\tBledhun is encamped east and slightly north of Caron's companions. Caron asked you to let Bledhun know that the few survivors of Caron's band are safe.\n",
[10673]="7002818B\n1\tAid Andras with The Broken Wheel\030Aid Andras with The Shredded Bag\030Aid Andras with The Smashed Crate\030Aid Andras with The Torn Ledger\tThe scattered pieces of Andras' caravan are on the northern road in Starkmoor. Andras asked you to judge the state of the caravan and retrieve whatever goods you can from the Dragon-clan raiders encamped to the east.\n2\tTalk to Andras in the Starkmoor\tAndras is on the northern road leading out of Starkmoor. Andras will be pleased to hear that his cart has been repaired and most of his goods returned.\n",
[10674]="7002FE6F\n1\tListen to Gandalf\tGandalf is on Treebeard's Hill in Fangorn. You should speak with Gandalf.\n2\tTalk to Gandalf upon Treebeard's Hill\tGandalf is on Treebeard's Hill in Fangorn. You should speak with Gandalf.\n",
[10675]="700687B2\n1\tCollect scholarly texts at Dâr Jeraf (total: 8)\tRimâti's scholarly texts may have been scattered around the ruins of Dâr Jeraf. Dâr Jeraf can be found in the north-western corner of the Tor-gardens.\n2\tTalk to Rimâti at the Pot and Quill\tYou have collected (hopefully) all of Rimâti's scholarly texts. You should return them to her at the Pot and Quill.\n",
[10676]="70042ED7\n1\tPotato sacks collected (total: 6)\tAnnaben paces near her overturned cart on the road south of Arnach. Annaben's cart tumbled off the ridge while she was taking a shortcut into town, spilling sacks of potatoes everywhere. She is terrified Haradrim will stumble across her before she can gather them up. You have offered to help gather them up.\n2\tTalk to Annaben\tAnnaben paces near her overturned cart on the road south of Arnach. Annaben's cart tumbled off the ridge while she was taking a shortcut into town, spilling sacks of potatoes everywhere. She is terrified Haradrim will stumble across her before she can gather them up. You should return to her with the sacks you have gathered.\n",
[10677]="7004CE3E\n1\tCollect honey jars (total: 5)\030Collect lembas bread (total: 7)\030Collect sacks of seeds (total: 5)\030Collect crates of honey cakes (total: 3)\030Collect barrels of cream (total: 3)\tThe Beornings' supplies are scattered in Eryn Lasgalen. You should gather the lost supplies.\n2\tTalk to Sterkist\tSterkist can be found at The Forest Gate, on the western edge of Eryn Lasgalen. You should talk to Sterkist.\n",
[10678]="7000ED94\n1\tCollect dwarf-picks (total: 10)\tCollect the dwarf-picks that were scattered when the supply convoy bound for Zigilgund was attacked. Thórth said they would likely be in and around the nearby mammoth graveyard.\n2\tReturn the dwarf-picks to Thórth\tYou have found the dwarf-picks that Thórth sent you to recover. You should return them to him at Zigilgund.\n",
[10679]="70035654\n1\tClimb the high peak to the west to look for survivors\tA high peak with a view of the Balewood can be found west of the refugees' cave. You should climb the peak and search for the refugees.\n2\tTalk to the man on the peak\tA man stands near his home, looking southward. You should speak with the man atop the western-most peak.\n",
[10680]="70043DFD\n1\tCollect Orkish blades (total: 10)\tOrkish blades can be found on the Eastern side of Osgiliath. You should collect Orkish blades.\n2\tBring the Orkish blades to Shíktarb\tShíktarb is at Shrak Mauruk. Bring the Orkish blades to Shíktarb.\n",
[10681]="70025A30\n1\tDefeat tomb-robbers at Barad Tharsír (total: 12)\tBarad Tharsír is located south-east of the colossus, in the Barandalf, on the far side of the Brandywine. Adleithian has asked you to defeat members of the robber-band that has taken Barad Tharsír.\n2\tTalk to Adleithian at the colossus\tAdleithian is at the Ranger-camp at the colossus, north-west of the Barandalf and west of Parth Aduial. Adleithian is waiting to hear that you have defeated the robbers at Barad Tharsír.\n",
[10682]="7006C507\n1\tDefeat jackals (total: 10)\030Burn defiled bodies (total: 6)\tYour mission is to travel to Khazâda and thin the numbers of jackals in the area as well as burn the corpses of slain travellers that have been defiled by the beasts.\n",
[10683]="7005873F\n1\tCollect broken swords (total: 12)\tBroken swords can be found scattered across the battlefield. You should collect any broken swords that you find.\n2\tGive the broken swords to Varthmath\tVarthmath can be found at Zarkul-sulûn. You should give the broken swords to Varthmath.\n",
[10684]="700156AF\n1\tCollect grodbog scent-glands (total: 10)\tGredbyg can be found in a hive in the Palace of Náin. You have been asked to collect anatomical items of interest from the gredbyg for study.\n2\tBring the scent-glands to Thórhall\tThórhall is at the small dwarf-camp in Lamab-dûm in the Great Delving. You should bring the scent-glands you have collected to Thórhall, so that he may study them.\n",
[10685]="7006EEC3\n1\tSpeak with Nimasi when you are ready to go\tSpeak with Nimasi outside the camp when you are ready to go.\n2\tDeliver Shâr Bârshud's message to Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar\tDeliver Shâr Bârshud's message to Mizâdi in Kûr Anzar.\n",
[10686]="7000AC9C\n1\tPresent your scholar's writs to Cachúnir in Rivendell\030Craft scholar's writs (total: 5)\tCachúnir is at Rivendell in the Trollshaws. Cachúnir has asked you to pen some scholar's writs to be preserved in the libraries of Valinor when the Elves of Rivendell sail into the West.\n",
[10687]="700359A4\n1\tScribe a tome of winter survival for the people of Wildermore (quantity: see journal)\tHildelith has given you a recipe for a tome of winter survival. You should craft a tome of winter survival for the survivors of Wildermore's bitter winter.\n2\tDeliver the tome of winter survival to Hildelith\tHildelith is in Forlaw. You have scripted a tome of winter survival, and should now deliver it to Hildelith.\n",
[10688]="7005B1EF\n1\tCollect caustic drake-whelp samples (total: 4)\030Collect chilling drake-whelp samples (total: 4)\tKordh Gúrat is located to the south-west of Aslíf, a level below the middle tier. Hórskur has asked for samples from each type of drakeling there.\n2\tTalk to Hórskur in Aslíf\tYou have collected a few samples from each type of drakeling. Hórskur is waiting for you in Aslíf on the upper tier to return with the samples.\n",
})
